## Scope of the Research Claims

This work is a **prospective structural research protocol**. No empirical or analytical examination of specific systems has been undertaken. Three of the four foundational documents remain pending adoption. The five functional units, five authorities, six lifecycle stages, and five alternative paths are **analytical proposals, not empirically validated categories**.

